    "description": "The Direct Debit Mandate Management API allows businesses to create and manage direct debit mandates associated with banking accounts. This API is primarily used by financial service providers and businesses seeking to automate payment processing. By enabling the establishment of direct debit agreements, the API supports seamless billing and payment management workflows. Typical use cases include onboarding new clients for recurring payments and updating existing mandates.",
